<div class="rounded-xl bg-olive-950 text-white p-4 shadow-lg text-xs leading-relaxed">
  <p class="font-semibold mb-2 text-olive-400 uppercase tracking-wide text-[10px]">How confidence is scored</p>
  <div class="space-y-2">
    <div class="flex gap-2 items-start">
      <span class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 font-semibold">High</span>
      <span class="text-olive-300">Guide and personal values agree (0.5×–2×), or Discogs corroborates either</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-2 items-start">
      <span class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 font-semibold">Medium</span>
      <span class="text-olive-300">Only one price source present</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-2 items-start">
      <span class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-300 font-semibold">Low</span>
      <span class="text-olive-300">Values disagree (2×–10× gap)</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-2 items-start">
      <span class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-red-500/20 text-red-300 font-semibold">Suspect</span>
      <span class="text-olive-300">Values wildly disagree (&gt;10× gap) or no pricing data</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
